    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you think a mirror can see other side? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you return home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How about this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player name is Kai. <br>He must escape from a closed house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother has asked you to go on a mission, but will you be able to fulfill your mission and return home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will have various endings depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard operation is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W/\u2191 S/\u2193 A/\u2190 D/\u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z/Enter: Decide\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc/X: Menu/Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift key: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl key: Skip message</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can be checked in the glowing area.<br>Some items can be checked even in non-glowing areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be checked from the menu.<br>Some items can be used from the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Normal clear : about 30 minutes to 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Full clear : about 2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000NORMAL/BAD/? (3 types)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hints</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSome items can be used from the item column.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can also check out items in places that are not lit up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIf you start a new game after clearing the game....</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you think a mirror can see other side? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you return home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How about this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player name is Kai. <br>He must escape from a closed house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother has asked you to go on a mission, but will you be able to fulfill your mission and return home safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will have various endings depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard operation is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W/\u2191 S/\u2193 A/\u2190 D/\u2192</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z/Enter: Decide\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc/X: Menu/Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift key: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl key: Skip message</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can be checked in the glowing area.<br>Some items can be checked even in non-glowing areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be checked from the menu.<br>Some items can be used from the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Normal clear : about 30 minutes to 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Full clear : about 2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000NORMAL/BAD/? (3 types)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hints</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSome items can be used from the item column.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can also check out items in places that are not lit up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIf you start a new game after clearing the game....</p>",
